# Supabase project settings -> API. Both values are public by design: the anon
# key is safe to ship only because every table has RLS on and all economy
# writes go through SECURITY DEFINER functions (see BUILD_PROMPT.md §3).
#
# Local development: copy this file to `.env.local` (gitignored).
# CI: set these as repository *variables*, not secrets (see SETUP.md).
VITE_SUPABASE_URL=https://your-project-ref.supabase.co
VITE_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=your-anon-key

# Optional. Overrides the GitHub Pages subpath that vite.config.ts derives from
# GITHUB_REPOSITORY. Set to "/" if you serve from a custom domain.
# VITE_BASE_PATH=/studycat/
